          totalPages={totalPages}
          pageInput={pageInput}
          handlePreviousPage={handlePreviousPage}
          handleNextPage={handleNextPage}
          handlePageInputChange={handlePageInputChange}
          handlePageSubmit={handlePageSubmit}
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};
```
**Explanation:**

The [HomeView](cci:1://file:///c:/Users/BisaiSantoshKumar%28Qu/OneDrive%20-%20Quadrant%20Resource%20LLC/Desktop/final_updated_frontend/sainath-final/client/src/components/manager/HomeView.jsx:2:0-55:2) component uses a combination of HTML and CSS to display the user's performance overview. It uses the `grid` layout to display three columns of data: average score, total users, and total assessments.

The component also renders a [RecentExamsTable](cci:1://file:///c:/Users/BisaiSantoshKumar%28Qu/OneDrive%20-%20Quadrant%20Resource%20LLC/Desktop/final_updated_frontend/sainath-final/client/src/components/manager/RecentExamsTable.jsx:2:0-63:2) component, which is a reusable component that displays a table of recent exams. The [RecentExamsTable](cci:1://file:///c:/Users/BisaiSantoshKumar%28Qu/OneDrive%20-%20Quadrant%20Resource%20LLC/Desktop/final_updated_frontend/sainath-final/client/src/components/manager/RecentExamsTable.jsx:2:0-63:2) component receives several props from the [HomeView](cci:1://file:///c:/Users/BisaiSantoshKumar%28Qu/OneDrive%20-%20Quadrant%20Resource%20LLC/Desktop/final_updated_frontend/sainath-final/client/src/components/manager/HomeView.jsx:2:0-55:2) component, including the recent exams data, current page number, total pages, and page input value.

The [HomeView](cci:1://file:///c:/Users/BisaiSantoshKumar%28Qu/OneDrive%20-%20Quadrant%20Resource%20LLC/Desktop/final_updated_frontend/sainath-final/client/src/components/manager/HomeView.jsx:2:0-55:2) component uses the `handlePreviousPage`, `handleNextPage`, `handlePageInputChange`, and `handlePageSubmit` functions to handle pagination and page input changes. These functions are passed as props from the parent component, [ManagerDashboard](cci:1://file:///c:/Users/BisaiSantoshKumar%28Qu/OneDrive%20-%20Quadrant%20Resource%20LLC/Desktop/final_updated_frontend/sainath-final/client/src/pages/ManagerDashboard.jsx:16:0-936:2).

Overall, the [HomeView](cci:1://file:///c:/Users/BisaiSantoshKumar%28Qu/OneDrive%20-%20Quadrant%20Resource%20LLC/Desktop/final_updated_frontend/sainath-final/client/src/components/manager/HomeView.jsx:2:0-55:2) component provides a concise and informative overview of the$0c089789-3017-4724-94a0-7e76cc62eb5c
