The `HomeView` component is returning a JSX (JavaScript XML) element, which is a syntax extension for JavaScript that allows you to write HTML-like code in your JavaScript files.

The JSX element is defined inside the function body, and it's what gets rendered to the DOM (Document Object Model) when the component is mounted.

