2. Sends a PUT request to the API to update the employee's role.
3. If the request is successful (status code 204), it updates the employee's role in the local state and displays a success message.
4. If the request fails, it logs the error and displays an error message.
5. Finally, it sets the loading state to false, regardless of the outcome.

