  ))}
</div>
```
This section renders a mobile-specific version of the employee list, using a different layout and design. It's only visible on small screens (md:hidden).

**Section 6: No Employees Found**
```jsx
<p className="text-gray-500 mt-2">
  {employeeSearchTerm ? "No employees found matching your search." : "No employees available."}
</p>
```
This section renders a message indicating that no employees were found, either because of a search term or because there are no employees available.

